## Backend and API

- Validate every request body and parameter at the boundary.
- Return errors in one consistent shape: a machine-readable code and a human-readable message.
- Check authorization on every endpoint, not only authentication.
- Never change the shape of an existing response without a version bump or a migration plan.
- Never edit a database migration after it has been merged; add a new one.
- Document every new endpoint next to its handler.
